stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> requested
  requested --> queued: 机器太忙
  queued --> requested: 负载回落
  requested --> claiming
  claiming --> refused: 房位被占
  claiming --> deploying
  deploying --> ready: 回执成功
  deploying --> deploy_failed: 回执失败
  deploying --> quarantined: 包装器失联
  quarantined --> deploy_failed: 确认创建者全部停止
  ready --> tearing_down
  deploy_failed --> tearing_down
  tearing_down --> teardown_failed: 快照失败 / 有残留
  teardown_failed --> tearing_down: owner 或 Lead 再拆（幂等）
  tearing_down --> releasing: 零残留 + 快照齐全
  releasing --> torn_down: 释放房位与服务记录
  refused --> [*]
  torn_down --> [*]
